  "content": "<h1><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdathost.net%252fr%252fbareneil%252fminecraft-server-hosting\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1475587/description_7bacedcb-1d61-4bd0-8d04-cb8a0b267406.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"81\"></a></h1><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/data-packs/apotheosis-addon-compat-datapack-version\" rel=\"nofollow\">神化附加兼容包（数据包版本）</a></strong></p><p><strong>神化/顶点附加兼容包是一个轻量级扩展，通过为多种生物主题模组提供直接支持来增强神化模组的功能。这确保了在您的世界中结合使用这些模组时，能实现无缝集成、渐进式体验以及更沉浸的游戏感受。</strong></p><h3><strong>兼容模组：</strong></h3><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/farlanders\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>远方来客</strong></a></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mob-variants\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>生物变种</strong></a></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/rotten-creatures\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>腐朽生物</strong></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div><p><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_a603daf8-e8f1-4e73-bd05-9efe58ec8960.png\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_dfac5920-0306-4325-9900-aef3beda631c.png\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_b64f8fc7-777d-4b4a-afa6-ec7c52f79ae5.png\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_34901759-264c-4fa6-a156-b02e92dc7a60.png\"></strong></p><p><strong>通过此扩展包，《神化》模组能与这些模组创造的多元世界自然衔接，让每次冒险体验更具整体性与吸引力。</strong></p>",
